# pop'n music 12 Iroha, NET TAISEN between two HIRAKU cabinets: this is the second (192.168.50.3),
# 300 frames behind the first in the menus; the song's presses keep the same frames, since the
# match starts the song on both at once. See popn12-nettaisen-a.his.
